{"product_id":"the-rough-guide-to-andalucia-rough-guide-travel-guides","title":"The Rough Guide to Andalucia (Rough Guide Travel Guides)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Rough Guide to Andalucia is the essential handbook to one of Europe's most vibrant destinations. Features include: - Full-colour section introducing Adalucia's highlights. - Incisive reviews of the best places to eat, sleep and drink, in every price range. - Comprehensive coverage of the region's spectacular attractions, from the stunning White Town of La Ronda to the remarkable prehistoric site of Los Millares. - Insider tips on where to find the best beaches and hikes. Expert background on Andalucia's history, culture and wildlife. - Maps and plans for every area. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:126 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Mark Ellingham \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781843530688 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 640\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43564238864537,"sku":"3RA9781843530688","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/d8ea17de406343a7319003823e81e9bd.jpg?v=1699253092","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-rough-guide-to-andalucia-rough-guide-travel-guides","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}